      "id": "c1000001-0001-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "IF - Drafts Empty",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are an education content specialist for Victoria Thang Long 3 School.\n\nTask: from the raw content provided, produce THREE versions:\n\n1. **Website version** (HTML):\n   - Use basic HTML tags (<h3>, <p>, <ul>, <li>)\n   - Formal, professional tone\n   - Include a clear heading\n\n2. **Zalo version** (plain text):\n   - No HTML\n   - Clear line breaks\n   - Friendly tone, easy to read on a phone\n   - Open with a fitting emoji (a plate for menus, a megaphone for announcements)\n\n3. **Facebook version** (social media):\n   - Lively, approachable tone\n   - Hashtags at the end: #VictoriaThangLong3 #VictoriaSchool\n   - Fitting emoji within the post\n\nReply EXACTLY in this JSON format (no markdown code block):\n{\"website_version\": \"...\", \"zalo_version\": \"...\", \"facebook_version\": \"...\"}\n\nToday's content: {{ $json['Content'] }}\nDate: {{ $json['Date'] }}"
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Produce 3 content versions for {{ $json['Date'] }}.\n\nSource content:\n{{ $json['Content'] }}\n\nSubmitted by: {{ $json['Submitted by'] }}"
      },
      "id": "c1000001-0001-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "AI Agent - Ollama Drafting",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        700,
        240
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
